-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ב/4: תשלום תוספת שחיקה לעובדי הוראה במסגרת הסכם קיבוצי
-- כללי ליישום רפורמת "עוז לתמורה"
-- The 2011 erosion addition of 2.1% from 1.9.2011 for teaching staff of the
-- owners' upper divisions, under section 39 of the general collective
-- agreement of 14.8.2011: who it applies to, the base it is computed on, what
-- it counts toward, and payment in September 2011.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשע"ב/4 תשלום תוספת שחיקה לעובדי הוראה`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (21.9.2011), reference number, addressee, and the lead-in: the general collective agreement of 14.8.2011 (approved by the Wage Commissioner) implements Oz LaTmura in the upper divisions, this circular publishes the erosion addition under its section 39, other changes are to follow; no rule of its own.

-- The corpus nests the page's sections 1 (תחולה) and 2 (יישום תוספת שחיקה)
-- under the second of the two numbered notes, and its section 3 (ביצוע
-- תשלומים) as two paragraphs of that note. The comments use the page's numbers.

-- akn:art_1 A note: a school entering the Oz LaTmura reform will be told so separately by the Ministry; no rule here.
-- akn:art_2/p1 A note: the agreement's text is on the Oz LaTmura website; no rule.

-- Time is counted in school months of 2011/12 (common.l4: September 2011 = 1).

@desc A school by the division of grades section 1ב uses.
DECLARE `school kind` IS ONE OF
    `a six-year school`
    `a three-year school`
    `another school`

@desc The division the school itself places a class in.
DECLARE `school division` IS ONE OF
    `the upper division`
    `the middle division`

@desc One portion of a teaching employee's employment by an owner, by the grade it teaches.
DECLARE `erosion portion` HAS
    `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by an owner of secondary education supervised by the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
    `kind of school`                     IS A `school kind`
    `grade taught`                       IS A NUMBER @desc 7 to 14 (ז' to י"ד)
    `division the school places it in`   IS A `school division`
    `in a three- or four-year upper division` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the school's upper division is a three- or four-year one (section 1א)
    `moved to Ofek Hadash in the middle school` IS A BOOLEAN @desc for a middle-school portion, the employee has moved to Ofek Hadash terms under the agreement of 25.12.2008
    `combined salary`                    IS A NUMBER @desc the combined salary of the portion, shekels a month
    `tosefet '87`                        IS A NUMBER
    `tosefet '94`                        IS A NUMBER
    `tosefet 2008 amount`                IS A NUMBER
    `tosefet 2001 amount`                IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `erosion action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the erosion addition` HAS `erosion paid` IS A NUMBER

§§ `1 תחולה`

@ref akn:art_2__hc_1__para_a
GIVEN p IS AN `erosion portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the employee is within section 1א` p IF
        p's `in the teaching-staff grade`
    AND p's `employed by an owner of secondary education supervised by the Ministry`
    AND p's `in a three- or four-year upper division`

-- Section 1ב: where the employee teaches in both divisions, only the upper
-- division's portion counts: grades ט'–י"ד in a six-year school, י'–י"ד in a
-- three-year school.
@ref akn:art_2__hc_1__para_b
GIVEN p IS AN `erosion portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an upper-division portion by section 1ב` p IF
    CONSIDER p's `kind of school`
    WHEN `a six-year school` THEN p's `grade taught` AT LEAST 9 AND p's `grade taught` AT MOST 14
    WHEN `a three-year school` THEN p's `grade taught` AT LEAST 10 AND p's `grade taught` AT MOST 14
    WHEN `another school` THEN p's `division the school places it in` EQUALS `the upper division`

-- F-2011-12_tashab_04-a: in a six-year school whose upper division is a
-- three-year one, grade 9 is in the school's middle division and section
-- 1ב's grades put it in the upper. The reading adopted: section 1ב's grades,
-- the clause written to settle exactly this split.
`section 1ב places in the upper division a grade the school places in the middle` MEANS
        `an upper-division portion by section 1ב` `grade 9 of a six-year school with a three-year upper division`
    AND `grade 9 of a six-year school with a three-year upper division`'s `division the school places it in` EQUALS `the middle division`
#ASSERT `section 1ב places in the upper division a grade the school places in the middle`

-- Section 1ג: the middle-school portion of such an employee, not yet under
-- Ofek Hadash, is to be paid for erosion under a collective agreement still
-- to be signed; its terms are not in this circular, so it is not priced here.
@ref akn:art_2__hc_1__para_c
GIVEN p IS AN `erosion portion`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `awaits the agreement still to be signed` p IF
        `the employee is within section 1א` p
    AND (NOT `an upper-division portion by section 1ב` p)
    AND (NOT p's `moved to Ofek Hadash in the middle school`)

§§ `2 יישום תוספת שחיקה בשיעור 2.1%`

`the erosion rate` MEANS 0.021

-- Section 2א: from 1.9.2011 the employees of section 1א are owed 2.1% of
-- the combined salary, tosefet '87, tosefet '94, tosefet 2008 and tosefet
-- 2001 ("תוספת שחיקה 2011"), on the upper-division portion (section 1ב).
@ref akn:art_2__hc_2__para_a
@export default The monthly 2011 erosion addition from 1.9.2011 for one portion of a teaching employee's employment under circular תשע"ב/4
GIVEN p IS AN `erosion portion` @desc the portion of employment, by the grade it teaches
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the erosion addition` p IS
    IF `the employee is within section 1א` p AND `an upper-division portion by section 1ב` p
    THEN `the erosion rate` TIMES `the base of the erosion addition` p
    ELSE 0

GIVEN p IS AN `erosion portion`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base of the erosion addition` p IS
    p's `combined salary`
    PLUS p's `tosefet '87`
    PLUS p's `tosefet '94`
    PLUS p's `tosefet 2008 amount`
    PLUS p's `tosefet 2001 amount`

-- Section 2ב: paid as a separate salary component, counted toward the
-- percentage additions from the combined salary except the five it names,
-- and toward the hourly value, severance pay and the three funds.
@ref akn:art_2__hc_2__para_b
GIVEN u IS AN `erosion use`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the erosion addition counts toward` u IF
    CONSIDER u
    WHEN `tosefet 2001` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `tosefet 2008` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `tosefet Oz LaTmura` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `tosefet 2011` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `promotion-grade addition` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

@desc A use the erosion addition may be counted toward, as section 2ב asks.
DECLARE `erosion use` IS ONE OF
    `percentage additions computed from the combined salary`
    `tosefet 2001`
    `tosefet 2008`
    `tosefet Oz LaTmura`
    `tosefet 2011`
    `promotion-grade addition`
    `the hourly value`
    `severance pay under the Severance Pay Law`
    `contributions to a pension provident fund, the study fund and the Dafna fund`

`how the erosion addition is paid` MEANS `a separate salary component`

DECLARE `payslip component` IS ONE OF
    `a separate salary component`
    `part of another component`

-- Section 2ג: tosefet Oz LaTmura and the promotion-grade addition are new
-- additions paid to a teaching employee who joined the Oz LaTmura reform,
-- under the agreement; further instructions are to follow.
@ref akn:art_2__hc_2__para_c
`the new additions for those who joined Oz LaTmura` MEANS
    LIST `tosefet Oz LaTmura`, `promotion-grade addition`

#ASSERT all (GIVEN u YIELD NOT `the erosion addition counts toward` u) `the new additions for those who joined Oz LaTmura`

§§ `3 ביצוע תשלומים`

@ref akn:art_2/p2 akn:art_2/p3
GIVEN p IS AN `erosion portion`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `erosion action`
DECIDE `paying the erosion addition with September's salary` p IS
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body`
    MUST  `pay the erosion addition` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the erosion addition` p
    WITHIN `month number` September
    LEST BREACH BY `the local authority or owning body` BECAUSE "section 3: the payments are made with the September 2011 salary"

-- akn:conclusions The contact line for questions, the sign-off and signature; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The salary figures are round placeholders.
`grade 9 of a six-year school with a three-year upper division` MEANS
    `erosion portion` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of secondary education supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `kind of school`                     IS `a six-year school`
        `grade taught`                       IS 9
        `division the school places it in`   IS `the middle division`
        `in a three- or four-year upper division` IS TRUE
        `moved to Ofek Hadash in the middle school` IS FALSE
        `combined salary`                    IS 8000
        `tosefet '87`                        IS 160
        `tosefet '94`                        IS 140
        `tosefet 2008 amount`                IS 400
        `tosefet 2001 amount`                IS 300

`grade 11 of a three-year school` MEANS
    `erosion portion` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of secondary education supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `kind of school`                     IS `a three-year school`
        `grade taught`                       IS 11
        `division the school places it in`   IS `the upper division`
        `in a three- or four-year upper division` IS TRUE
        `moved to Ofek Hadash in the middle school` IS FALSE
        `combined salary`                    IS 8000
        `tosefet '87`                        IS 160
        `tosefet '94`                        IS 140
        `tosefet 2008 amount`                IS 400
        `tosefet 2001 amount`                IS 300

`grade 8 of a six-year school` MEANS
    `erosion portion` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of secondary education supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `kind of school`                     IS `a six-year school`
        `grade taught`                       IS 8
        `division the school places it in`   IS `the middle division`
        `in a three- or four-year upper division` IS TRUE
        `moved to Ofek Hadash in the middle school` IS FALSE
        `combined salary`                    IS 8000
        `tosefet '87`                        IS 160
        `tosefet '94`                        IS 140
        `tosefet 2008 amount`                IS 400
        `tosefet 2001 amount`                IS 300

#ASSERT `the erosion addition` `grade 11 of a three-year school` EQUALS 189
#ASSERT `the erosion addition` `grade 8 of a six-year school` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `awaits the agreement still to be signed` `grade 8 of a six-year school`

#TRACE `paying the erosion addition with September's salary` `grade 11 of a three-year school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the erosion addition` 189 AT 1
#TRACE `paying the erosion addition with September's salary` `grade 11 of a three-year school` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the local authority or owning body` DOES `pay the erosion addition` 100 AT 1

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over a finite space: every kind of school, grades 7 to 14,
-- either division the school may place a class in, every combination of
-- the grade, the owner, a three- or four-year upper division and the move
-- to Ofek Hadash, and combined salaries from 0 to 12,000 in steps of 3,000.

`every school kind` MEANS LIST `a six-year school`, `a three-year school`, `another school`
`both divisions` MEANS LIST `the upper division`, `the middle division`
`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`grades checked` MEANS range 7 14
`salaries checked` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k TIMES 3000) (range 0 4)

GIVEN g IS A BOOLEAN, u IS A BOOLEAN, o IS A BOOLEAN, k IS A `school kind`, n IS A NUMBER, d IS A `school division`, s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `erosion portion`
DECIDE `a checked portion` g u o k n d s IS
    `erosion portion` WITH
        `in the teaching-staff grade`        IS g
        `employed by an owner of secondary education supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `kind of school`                     IS k
        `grade taught`                       IS n
        `division the school places it in`   IS d
        `in a three- or four-year upper division` IS u
        `moved to Ofek Hadash in the middle school` IS o
        `combined salary`                    IS s
        `tosefet '87`                        IS s DIVIDED BY 50
        `tosefet '94`                        IS s DIVIDED BY 60
        `tosefet 2008 amount`                IS s DIVIDED BY 20
        `tosefet 2001 amount`                IS s DIVIDED BY 25

GIVEN p IS AN `erosion portion`, g IS A BOOLEAN, u IS A BOOLEAN, o IS A BOOLEAN, s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sections 1 and 2 hold for` p g u o s IF
    LET e MEANS `the erosion addition` p
        paid MEANS `the employee is within section 1א` p AND `an upper-division portion by section 1ב` p
    IN      e AT LEAST 0
        AND e EQUALS (IF paid THEN 0.021 TIMES `the base of the erosion addition` p ELSE 0)
        AND `the employee is within section 1א` p EQUALS (g AND u)
        AND ((NOT `awaits the agreement still to be signed` p) OR (g AND u AND (NOT o) AND NOT paid))
        AND ((NOT (g AND u)) OR paid OR o OR `awaits the agreement still to be signed` p)
        AND e AT MOST `the erosion addition` (`a checked portion` g u o (p's `kind of school`) (p's `grade taught`) (p's `division the school places it in`) (s PLUS 3000))

-- Sections 1 and 2 over the whole space: the erosion addition is never
-- negative and is 2.1% of its base exactly on an upper-division portion of
-- an employee within section 1א; a middle-school portion of such an
-- employee is either under Ofek Hadash or awaits the agreement still to be
-- signed, and only such a portion awaits it; the addition never falls as
-- the salary grows.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                all (GIVEN u YIELD
                        all (GIVEN o YIELD
                                all (GIVEN k YIELD
                                        all (GIVEN n YIELD
                                                all (GIVEN d YIELD
                                                        all (GIVEN s YIELD
                                                                `sections 1 and 2 hold for` (`a checked portion` g u o k n d s) g u o s)
                                                            `salaries checked`)
                                                    `both divisions`)
                                            `grades checked`)
                                    `every school kind`)
                            `both booleans`)
                    `both booleans`)
            `both booleans`

-- Section 1ב: in a six-year or three-year school the upper division is
-- every grade from its first one up, so a higher grade is never out of it
-- when a lower one is in.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN k YIELD
                all (GIVEN n YIELD
                        (NOT `an upper-division portion by section 1ב` (`a checked portion` TRUE TRUE FALSE k n `the middle division` 0))
                        OR `an upper-division portion by section 1ב` (`a checked portion` TRUE TRUE FALSE k (n PLUS 1) `the middle division` 0))
                    (range 7 13))
            (LIST `a six-year school`, `a three-year school`)

-- F-2011-12_tashab_04-a over every grade of a six-year school, its upper
-- division three or four years long and each class placed by the school
-- accordingly (from grade 10, or from grade 9): section 1ב and the school's
-- own division part exactly at grade 9 with a three-year upper division.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN three YIELD
                all (GIVEN n YIELD
                        LET d MEANS IF n AT LEAST (IF three THEN 10 ELSE 9) THEN `the upper division` ELSE `the middle division`
                            p MEANS `a checked portion` TRUE TRUE FALSE `a six-year school` n d 8000
                        IN  (`an upper-division portion by section 1ב` p EQUALS (d EQUALS `the upper division`))
                            EQUALS NOT (three AND n EQUALS 9))
                    `grades checked`)
            `both booleans`

-- Section 2ב over every use: the addition counts toward every use but the
-- five additions it names.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN u YIELD
                `the erosion addition counts toward` u
                EQUALS NOT elem u (LIST `tosefet 2001`, `tosefet 2008`, `tosefet Oz LaTmura`, `tosefet 2011`, `promotion-grade addition`))
            (LIST `percentage additions computed from the combined salary`, `tosefet 2001`, `tosefet 2008`, `tosefet Oz LaTmura`,
                  `tosefet 2011`, `promotion-grade addition`, `the hourly value`, `severance pay under the Severance Pay Law`,
                  `contributions to a pension provident fund, the study fund and the Dafna fund`)

-- F-2011-12_tashab_04-b: circular תשע"ב/10 counts the upper division of a
-- six-year school from grade י' (10); section 1ב here counts it from ט' (9).
`the first upper-division grade תשע"ב/10 gives a six-year school` MEANS 10

`section 1ב counts grade 9 of a six-year school, which תשע"ב/10 does not` MEANS
        `an upper-division portion by section 1ב` (`a checked portion` TRUE TRUE FALSE `a six-year school` 9 `the middle division` 0)
    AND 9 LESS THAN `the first upper-division grade תשע"ב/10 gives a six-year school`
#ASSERT `section 1ב counts grade 9 of a six-year school, which תשע"ב/10 does not`
